# Regenerable Tacit artifacts. The store itself (.tacit/memory.db, Markdown
# memories, config and the project map) is tracked: it is the project's
# institutional memory and must travel with the code. Only caches and scratch
# copies are excluded here.
.tacit/models/
.tacit/_*/

# Mock projects and per-machine state created by the test suite. Every fixture
# builds its workspace under tests/_*/ so tests never touch a real project.
/tests/_*/